HeaderInclude
config/e2k/e2k-opts.h

march=
Target RejectNegative Joined Enum(e2k_arch) Var(e2k_arch) Init(3)
-march=elbrus-vN	Generate code for ISA version N (3 to 7).

Enum
Name(e2k_arch) Type(int)
Known E2K ISA versions (for use with the -march= option):

EnumValue
Enum(e2k_arch) String(elbrus-v3) Value(3)

EnumValue
Enum(e2k_arch) String(elbrus-v4) Value(4)

EnumValue
Enum(e2k_arch) String(elbrus-v5) Value(5)

EnumValue
Enum(e2k_arch) String(elbrus-v6) Value(6)

EnumValue
Enum(e2k_arch) String(elbrus-v7) Value(7)

mbundle
Target Var(e2k_bundle) Init(1)
Pack operations into wide instructions after scheduling (default).  With -mno-bundle every operation is its own wide instruction and gas picks the channel.

mnops
Target Var(e2k_nops) Init(1)
Pad the gap between a producer and its consumer with nop N when the scheduler knows the latency.

mdbl
Target Var(e2k_dbl) Init(0)
Emit setwd dbl = 1 (32-bit integer operations zero-extend) instead of lcc's dbl = 0.
